    {"id":"tbi:009","original":"ちとせの部屋だ。","translation":"치토세의 방이다.","state":"final","use_translation":true},
    {"id":"tbi:010","original":"ちょっとひと休みしていこうかな？","translation":"잠깐 쉬었다 갈까？","state":"final","use_translation":true},
    {"id":"tbi:011","original":"てもらえるぞ。","translation":"있다.","state":"final","use_translation":true},
